{"about_the_game":"A retro sci-fi first-person/third-person shooter similar to the Star Wars: Battlefront and Rogue Squadron series.<br />\r\nThe game  focuses on the battle between the 21st century humans and the first ever alien race visiting Earth.<br />\r\nBefore there were any of your favorite Sci-Fi films, there were the 21st century humans, encountering the first ever intelligent life beyond their planet.<br />\r\nThe player will battle the alien race - and their monster creations  - with various weapons and abilities such as, rolling, sprinting, vaulting, and crouching, over the course of several missions in a single-player campaign mode, all viewable from several camera angles.<br />\r\nVarious vehicles will also be available to the player's disposal to achieve certain goals in all of the missions.<br />\r\nPeer-to-Peer Online and Local Multiplayer is now also available.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish All Single Player Missions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1643700/c087043b5d4881428b0ad7f93252aa61b20464ae.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Stars in All Single Player Missions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1643700/a755fba84adca30ab29e65e2d694dc54095ae6db.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Stars in All But FreeForAll Multiplayer Missions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1643700/a03e1c2ec4e2ef24f32c8a4a85a8caa83125ae28.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Stars in All Other Achievements","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1643700/626d424479d436903068579639d420508691cae6.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Star in any Single Player mission.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1643700/cf8bf17eab49a781fa8e1c74415f55039a39dab2.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Star in any Single Player mission.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1643700/7d4283cf4f9e337f3e9277